Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 12:52:21 +0400
Subject: [PATCH 03/18] fix(newcomer): cold open shows the person with a
 decision waiting

The newcomer app defaulted to the newest seed hire (Tomasz, 0 of 3 documents, empty feed
and passport), the least informative first screen. A hire created during the demo still
wins; otherwise the default is the hire with a pending approval. Pure defaultHire() with tests.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
